\subsection{Particles}
We define a particle type which contains only four-momentum and
invariant mass squared, and a flag that tells whether the momentum is
filled or not.
<<PHS trees: public>>=
  public :: phs_prt_t
<<PHS trees: types>>=
  type :: phs_prt_t
     private
     logical :: defined = .false.
     type(vector4_t) :: p
     real(default) :: p2
  end type phs_prt_t

